      "message_parsed": "Как настроить чтобы сайт отправлял почту с этого адреса <a href=\"mailto:assasinfil@agn.ru\">assasinfil@agn.ru</a> (gmail почта на домен не смотрите)<br />\nКопирую мой конфиг тестовый<br />\n// Email                                                                                                                                     <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;emailer_disabled&#039;]        = false;                                                                                                 <br />\n                                                                                                                                            <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;smtp_delivery&#039;]           = false; // send email via a named server instead of the local mail function                             <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;smtp_ssl&#039;]                = true; // use ssl connect                                                                               <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;smtp_host&#039;]               = &#039;smtp.gmail.com&#039;;    // SMTP server host                                                               <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;smtp_port&#039;]               = 465;    // SMTP server port                                                                             <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;smtp_username&#039;]           = &#039;<a href=\"mailto:assasinfil@agn.ru\">assasinfil@agn.ru</a>&#039;;    // enter a username if your SMTP server requires it                             <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;smtp_password&#039;]           = &#039;pass&#039;;    // enter a password if your SMTP server requires it                                     <br />\n                                                                                                                                            <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;board_email&#039;]             = &quot;<a href=\"mailto:assasinfil@agn.ru\">assasinfil@agn.ru</a>&quot;; // admin email address                                                             <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;board_email_form&#039;]        = false;        // can users send email to each other via board                                           <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;board_email_sig&#039;]         = &#039;&#039;;           // this text will be attached to all emails the board sends                               <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;board_email_sitename&#039;]    = $domain_name; // sitename used in all emails header                                                     <br />\n                                                                                                                                            <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;topic_notify_enabled&#039;]    = true;                                                                                                   <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;pm_notify_enabled&#039;]       = true;                                                                                                   <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;group_send_email&#039;]        = true;                                                                                                   <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;email_change_disabled&#039;]   = false;        // disable changing email by user                                                         <br />\n                                                                                                                                            <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;tech_admin_email&#039;]        = &quot;<a href=\"mailto:assasinfil@agn.ru\">assasinfil@agn.ru</a>&quot;; // email for sending error reports                                                 <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;abuse_email&#039;]             = &quot;<a href=\"mailto:assasinfil@agn.ru\">assasinfil@agn.ru</a>&quot;;                                                                                   <br />\n$bb_cfg[&#039;adv_email&#039;]               = &quot;<a href=\"mailto:assasinfil@agn.ru\">assasinfil@agn.ru</a>&quot;;                                                    при попытке отправить почту из админки вылазит ошибка Failed sending email :: PHP ::<br />\nOS Ubuntu 15.10 VPS host-food.ru",
